-  - `imrphenom_hm.py` & `taylorf2_hm.py`: García-Quirós et al. (2020) PRD 102, 064002 Eq. (3)
-  - `imrphenomd.py`: Khan et al. (2016) PRD 93, 044007 Table V and Eqs. (24), (28)–(32)
